# Practical 4 – Display 10 Student Names

## Aim

To create an Angular application to display 10 student names using an array.

## Objective

To understand how an array is created in Angular and how student names can be displayed on a web page.

## Technologies Used

- Angular
- TypeScript
- HTML
- CSS
- Visual Studio Code

## 1. app.ts
import { Component, signal } from '@angular/core';
import { RouterOutlet } from '@angular/router';

@Component({
  selector: 'app-root',
  imports: [RouterOutlet],
  templateUrl: './app.html',
  styleUrl: './app.css'
})
export class App {

  students = [
    'Aarti',
    'Akshata',
    'Aishwarya',
    'Gauri',
    'Bhumika',
    'Pooja',
    'Rohit',
    'Rushi',
    'Pallavi',
    'Aditya'
  ];
}

